A total of 15 OCXTs was performed. Mean cardiopulmonary bypass and graft ischemic times were 82.1 and 56.5 minutes, respectively (
Table 3
). Fourteen of 15 baboons were successfully weaned from cardiopulmonary bypass, although 3 died within 24 hours. Eight of 15 baboons survived >1 month with a functioning xenograft.
